# Bard Necro Enhanced: sustain, bard control, necro burst, opener and damage rotation.
# Design, cooldown model and every barding number: content/public/templates/bard-necro.md
# (design in part 5, mechanics in part 2).
# Needs: Discordance, Peacemaking and Provocation trained (the song round robin parks on a
# missing one), an instrument in the backpack, a necromancer book, and reagents.
# Provo candidates: V (closest monster), or Shift+Space (Set Last Target, Beneficial),
# then [ provo, set ]. Q changes only the bard target. Register in warmode until native
# cursor overlap is checked in-game (content/public/questions/open-items.md part 17).
# The hotbar's own Auto-Renew must be OFF for every ability this loop drives: it spends
# the same symbols, cheapest first.
# cooldowns.xml carries every bar this loop reads: music, song, disco, peace/provo, magic
# arrow, harm, fireball, lightning, heal pot, reflect and walk. The names are lowercase
# and the glossary is content/public/scripting/overheads.md.
# A fight is a hostile inside target_range. In a fight: Provocation of the enemies you
# picked onto each other, Discordance, Peacemaking, the necro burst, the opener, the proc
# core, the filler and Poison Strike. On the walk: the self buffs, Spell Siphon, the bard
# song and Vampiric Embrace. Mushrooms are eaten in either, and Create Food makes more on
# the walk.
# The two summons are kept out in either: Vengeful Spirit, then the missing one. Under 65
# mana Wither pays part of the cast, and the other necro abilities leave it the symbols.
# With no enemy near, a summon out ten minutes is released by name and cast again.
# Warmode is the player's manual window: our casts, the bard skills, the self buffs,
# Create Food, the summons, Corpse Skin and Evil Omen stand down. Cures, heals, potions,
# the mushroom and Blood Oath keep running.
# Herding is off: the slot went to Resisting Spells on 2026-09-27. Add tamer/herding to the
# blocks when it comes back.
# Hotkeys: Drink Cure, > Smart Heal/Cure Self, Drink Heal, > Greater Heal/Cure Self,
#          Cancel Current Target, Drink Refresh, Drink Strength, Drink Agility, Drink Magic Resist,
#          Eat Magic Mushroom, Vengeful Spirit, Wither, > Interrupt, Blood Oath, Corpse Skin,
#          Evil Omen, Poison Strike, Target Self, Vampiric Embrace.
# Generated from recipe/bard-necro-enhanced-recipe.razor by util/build-scripts.mjs. Edit module/ and recipe/, not this file.


